OL,3,AWoman injures three people in third
OL,4,APoland school knife attack in a week
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been arrested after
OL,7,Finjuring three people in a third knife
OL,8,Fattack recorded at schools in Poland
OL,9,Fthis week.
OL,11,FThe 21-year-old used a "dangerous
OL,12,Fobject" to attack a 17-year-old girl at
OL,13,Fan educational institution in the
OL,14,Fcapital, Warsaw, police told news
OL,15,Fagencies PAP and AP.
OL,17,FIt comes a day after thousands of
OL,18,Fpolice visited schools across Poland,
OL,19,Ffollowing two stabbing attacks earlier
OL,20,Fin the week, one of which led to the
OL,21,Fkilling of a female caretaker.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
